  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>1 By the Sea<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Nestled in the charming Seagrove Beach area, this spacious house is the perfect retreat for your next family vacation. With a variety of amenities and a prime location near the ocean, this dog-friendly rental offers everything you need for a relaxing and enjoyable stay.<br><br><br><br>Step inside to discover a well-appointed interior featuring a game room, comfortable living spaces, and multiple bedrooms including a king bed, queen bed, double bed, and twin bed, ensuring plenty of room for everyone in your group. The living room is the perfect spot to unwind after a day at the beach, with a cozy sofa and a TV for entertainment.<br><br><br><br>Outside, you'll find a deck, patio, and balcony where you can soak up the Florida sunshine or enjoy al fresco dining with the gas grill. Take a refreshing dip in the heated pool or relax in the plunge pool, while the enclosed yard provides a safe space for your furry friends to play.<br><br><br><br>For those looking to explore the area, adult bikes are provided for your convenience, making it easy to visit nearby attractions such as fishing spots or the beautiful beach just a short distance away. And after a day of adventure, rinse off in the outdoor shower before settling in for a peaceful evening in this family-friendly home.<br><br><br><br>Whether you're seeking a fun-filled family vacation or a relaxing getaway by the sea, this Santa Rosa Beach house has everything you need for a memorable stay. Book now and start planning your dream vacation in this beautiful coastal destination!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Spacious Home with Private Pool, dog-friendly, 2 Blocks to Beach"
        }
      ],
